{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19129","headline":"窦夔州见寄寒食日忆故姬小红吹笙因和之 · 刘禹锡","name":"窦夔州见寄寒食日忆故姬小红吹笙因和之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸾声窈眇管参差，清韵初调衆乐随。\n幽院妆成花下弄，高楼月好夜深吹。\n忽惊暮雨飘零尽，唯有朝云梦想期。\n闻道今年寒食日，东山旧路独行迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}